  "scene": {
    "id": 0,
    "language": "[0]I need to get possession of the ball to start the play. Both strikers are covered, I will pass to the right-winger to build up from the side. [1][2]Good observation that both the left striker and right striker are covered. It's... There's not enough room to pass to them. In your... In this situation, both the right and left-winger are open, so you could pass to either of them. [3]After passing to your right-winger, or really any teammate, go support them. Supporting them means sh- giving them a pass option that's away from a defender and you're pretty close to them, within five feet.",
